<title>USA: Computer Management sets 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>Computer Management sets 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer Management Sciences Inc said its board has approved a three-for-two stock split to be distributed on November 20, 1996 to holders of record on November 4, 1996.</p>
<p>Cash in lieu of fractional shares will be based upon the closing price of the company's stock as of the record date, Computer Management said.</p>
<p>After the stock split, the company will have 12.4 million shares of common stock, it said.</p>
